{"id": "936d3478-de25-49c5-87dd-3135e149cbdc", "slug": "dynamic-cart-data-shopify", "title": "Dynamic Cart Data - Shopify", "description": "Dynamic Cart Card Component is designed for building reusable UI components in modern web projects. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.", "content": "---\nversion: \"neuform-staff-featured-2026-05-22\"\nname: \"Dynamic Cart Data - Shopify\"\ndescription: \"Dynamic Cart Card Component is designed for building reusable UI components in modern web projects. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.\"\ncolors:\n  primary: \"#00E559\"\n  secondary: \"#0A0A0A\"\n  accent: \"#00E559\"\n  background: \"#030303\"\n  surface: \"#18181B\"\n  text-primary: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  text-secondary: \"#A1A1AA\"\n  border: \"#27272A\"\ntypography:\n  display-lg:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"64px\"\n    fontWeight: 500\n    lineHeight: \"1.04\"\n    letterSpacing: \"0\"\n  body-md:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"16px\"\n    fontWeight: 400\n    lineHeight: \"1.6\"\n  label-md:\n    fontFamily: \"JetBrains Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"12px\"\n    fontWeight: 600\n    lineHeight: \"1.2\"\nspacing:\n  base: \"8px\"\n  gap: \"16px\"\n  card-padding: \"24px\"\n  section-padding: \"80px\"\nrounded:\n  card: \"23px\"\n  control: \"23px\"\n  pill: \"9999px\"\ncomponents:\n  card:\n    background: \"Use the surface token with subtle borders and HTML-matched shadow depth\"\n    radius: \"Match the declared card radius token\"\n  button:\n    background: \"Use primary or accent colors for the main action\"\n    radius: \"Use the control or pill radius based on the source HTML\"\n---\n# Dynamic Cart Data - Shopify\nSource: Neuform staff featured templates. Author: Sourany Phomhome (@sou). Views: 160; favorites: 11; remixes: 0.\nTags: card, animated, bento, action, effect.\n## Overview\nDynamic Cart Card Component is designed for building reusable UI components in modern web projects. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.\n\nEasy to use Dynamic cart data fetched directly from Shopify. Cart Note Product Card Image Gallery Cart Count Option Selector On Sale Sale Tag Count\n## Composition\nUse the attached HTML reference as the source of truth. Preserve the visible hierarchy, first-screen composition, section rhythm, density, and interaction tone before adapting copy or content.\nKey visible headings include: Dynamic cart data fetched directly from Shopify..\n## Colors\nAnchor the palette in primary #00E559, secondary #0A0A0A, accent #00E559, background #030303, surface #18181B, text-primary #FFFFFF. Keep background, surface, text, and border roles distinct so generated layouts retain the same contrast pattern as the source.\n## Typography\nUse Inter for display moments and Inter for body copy unless the HTML clearly demands a compatible fallback. Labels and technical metadata should use JetBrains Mono or an equivalent mono face.\n## Layout\nKeep spacing deliberate and stable. Favor the same grid direction, max-width behavior, card density, and responsive stacking seen in the HTML. Do not replace distinctive source structures with generic SaaS sections.\n## Components\nCards, buttons, badges, navigation, and repeated blocks should preserve the source geometry, border treatment, and hover feel.\n## Motion\nPreserve existing motion cues such as masked reveals, staggered entrance, hover lift, scroll-triggered transitions, and ambient movement. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## WebGL & Effects\n\nIf the source includes canvas, WebGL, Three.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Dynamic Cart Data - Shopify</title>\n\n    <!-- Tailwind CSS -->\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n\n    <!-- Iconify -->\n    <script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n\n    <!-- GSAP -->\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/gsap.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/ScrollTrigger.min.js\"></script>\n\n    <style>\n        /* Essential base styles to ensure clean rendering */\n        body {\n            -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;\n            -moz-osx-font-smoothing: grayscale;\n        }\n        /* Hide scrollbar for a cleaner look while maintaining scrollability if needed */\n        ::-webkit-scrollbar {\n            display: none;\n        }\n    </style>\n</head>\n<body class=\"bg-[#030303] text-white font-sans overflow-x-hidden selection:bg-[#00E559] selection:text-black\">\n\n    <!-- Ambient Background Glow -->\n    <div class=\"fixed top-[-20%] right-[-10%] w-[800px] h-[800px] bg-[#00E559]/5 rounded-full blur-[150px] pointer-events-none z-0\"></div>\n\n    <main class=\"relative min-h-screen w-full flex items-center pt-24 pb-12 lg:py-0\">\n\n        <div class=\"container mx-auto px-6 relative z-10 grid lg:grid-cols-12 gap-12 items-center\">\n\n            <!-- Left Content: Text -->\n            <div class=\"lg:col-span-5 flex flex-col items-start z-20\">\n                <p class=\"text-[#00E559] text-lg sm:text-xl font-normal mb-6 tracking-wide gs-reveal opacity-0\" style=\"transform: translateY(20px);\">\n                    Easy to use\n                </p>\n\n                <!-- Masked Reveal Headline -->\n                <h1 class=\"text-5xl sm:text-6xl lg:text-[4.5rem] leading-[1.05] tracking-tight font-medium text-white max-w-2xl\">\n                    <span class=\"inline-block overflow-hidden align-bottom\">\n                        <span class=\"gs-word inline-block\" style=\"transform: translateY(100%);\">Dynamic</span>\n                    </span>\n                    <span class=\"inline-block overflow-hidden align-bottom\">\n                        <span class=\"gs-word inline-block\" style=\"transform: translateY(100%);\">cart</span>\n                    </span>\n                    <span class=\"inline-block overflow-hidden align-bottom\">\n                        <span class=\"gs-word inline-block\" style=\"transform: translateY(100%);\">data</span>\n                    </span>\n                    <br>\n                    <span class=\"inline-block overflow-hidden align-bottom\">\n                        <span class=\"gs-word inline-block\" style=\"transform: translateY(100%);\">fetched</span>\n                    </span>\n                    <span class=\"inline-block overflow-hidden align-bottom\">\n                        <span class=\"gs-word inline-block\" style=\"transform: translateY(100%);\">directly</span>\n                    </span>\n                    <br>\n                    <span class=\"inline-block overflow-hidden align-bottom pt-2\">\n                        <span class=\"gs-word inline-block font-serif italic tracking-normal text-white/95\" style=\"transform: translateY(100%);\">from Shopify.</span>\n                    </span>\n                </h1>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Right Content: Animated Grid Schema -->\n            <!-- Positioned absolutely on desktop to allow overflow without pushing layout -->\n            <div class=\"lg:absolute lg:top-1/2 lg:-translate-y-1/2 lg:right-[-10%] lg:w-[60vw] z-10 w-full mt-12 lg:mt-0 perspective-1000\">\n\n                <!-- Wrapper for continuous subtle floating animation -->\n                <div class=\"gs-float-wrapper w-full flex justify-center lg:justify-end\">\n\n                    <!-- The rotated grid container -->\n                    <div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-3 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-4 sm:gap-6 w-[800px] lg:w-[1000px] origin-center\" style=\"transform: rotate(-12deg) scale(1.05);\">\n\n                        <!-- Row 1 -->\n                        <div class=\"card-wrapper gs-card opacity-0 translate-y-12 col-start-2 lg:col-start-3\">\n                            <!-- Gradient Border Wrapper -->\n                            <div class=\"p-[1px] rounded-3xl bg-gradient-to-b from-white/10 to-transparent w-full aspect-square\">\n                                <!-- Inner Card -->\n                                <div class=\"w-full h-full bg-[#0A0A0A] rounded-[23px] flex flex-col items-center justify-center gap-4 relative overflow-hidden shadow-2xl shadow-black/50\">\n                                    <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-b from-white/[0.02] to-transparent pointer-events-none\"></div>\n                                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:document-text-linear\" class=\"text-3xl text-neutral-600 relative z-10\"></iconify-icon>\n                                    <span class=\"text-neutral-500 text-xs font-normal relative z-10\">Cart Note</span>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n\n                        <!-- Row 2 -->\n                        <div class=\"card-wrapper gs-card opacity-0 translate-y-12\">\n                            <div class=\"p-[1px] rounded-3xl bg-gradient-to-b from-white/10 to-transparent w-full aspect-square\">\n                                <div class=\"w-full h-full bg-[#0A0A0A] rounded-[23px] flex flex-col items-center justify-center gap-4 relative overflow-hidden\">\n                                    <div class=\"w-8 h-1 rounded-full bg-[#00E559]/30 relative z-10 mb-2\"></div>\n                                    <span class=\"text-neutral-500 text-xs font-normal relative z-10\">Product Card</span>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n\n                        <div class=\"card-wrapper gs-card opacity-0 translate-y-12\">\n                            <div class=\"p-[1px] rounded-3xl bg-gradient-to-b from-white/10 to-transparent w-full aspect-square\">\n                                <div class=\"w-full h-full bg-[#0A0A0A] rounded-[23px] flex flex-col items-center justify-center gap-4 relative overflow-hidden\">\n                                     <div class=\"flex gap-1.5 relative z-10\">\n                                        <div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-neutral-700\"></div>\n                                        <div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-[#00E559]\"></div>\n                                        <div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-neutral-700\"></div>\n                                    </div>\n                                    <span class=\"text-neutral-400 text-xs font-normal relative z-10\">Image Gallery</span>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n\n                        <div class=\"card-wrapper gs-card opacity-0 translate-y-12\">\n                            <div class=\"p-[1px] rounded-3xl bg-gradient-to-b from-white/15 to-transparent w-full aspect-square\">\n                                <div class=\"w-full h-full bg-[#0A0A0A] rounded-[23px] flex flex-col items-center justify-center gap-4 relative overflow-hidden\">\n                                    <div class=\"absolute top-1/2 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-16 h-16 bg-[#00E559]/10 blur-xl rounded-full\"></div>\n                                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:box-linear\" class=\"text-3xl text-[#00E559] relative z-10\"></iconify-icon>\n                                    <span class=\"text-neutral-300 text-xs font-normal relative z-10\">Cart Count</span>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n\n                        <div class=\"card-wrapper gs-card opacity-0 translate-y-12 hidden lg:block\">\n                             <div class=\"p-[1px] rounded-3xl bg-gradient-to-b from-white/5 to-transparent w-full aspect-square\">\n                                <div class=\"w-full h-full bg-[#0A0A0A] rounded-[23px] flex flex-col items-center justify-center gap-4 opacity-50\">\n                                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:tag-horizontal-linear\" class=\"text-3xl text-[#00E559]/50\"></iconify-icon>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n\n                        <!-- Row 3 -->\n                        <div class=\"card-wrapper gs-card opacity-0 translate-y-12 hidden sm:block\">\n                            <div class=\"p-[1px] rounded-3xl bg-gradient-to-b from-white/5 to-transparent w-full aspect-square\">\n                                <div class=\"w-full h-full bg-[#0A0A0A] rounded-[23px] opacity-20\"></div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n\n                        <div class=\"card-wrapper gs-card opacity-0 translate-y-12\">\n                            <div class=\"p-[1px] rounded-3xl bg-gradient-to-b from-white/15 to-transparent w-full aspect-square scale-105 relative z-20\">\n                                <div class=\"w-full h-full bg-[#0D0D0D] rounded-[23px] flex flex-col items-center justify-center gap-5 relative overflow-hidden border border-white/5 shadow-2xl shadow-[#00E559]/5\">\n\n                                    <!-- Custom Option Selector UI -->\n                                    <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-2.5 relative z-10 w-full px-6 mt-2\">\n                                        <!-- Active -->\n                                        <div class=\"w-full h-5 bg-[#00E559] rounded-full relative\">\n                                            <div class=\"absolute right-0 top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 translate-x-1/4 w-5 h-5 bg-[#0D0D0D] rounded-full flex items-center justify-center border-[1.5px] border-[#00E559]\">\n                                                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:check-read-linear\" class=\"text-[10px] text-[#00E559]\" stroke-width=\"2\"></iconify-icon>\n                                            </div>\n                                        </div>\n                                        <!-- Inactive -->\n                                        <div class=\"w-full h-5 border-[1.5px] border-neutral-800 rounded-full\"></div>\n                                        <div class=\"w-full h-5 border-[1.5px] border-neutral-800 rounded-full\"></div>\n                                    </div>\n\n                                    <span class=\"text-neutral-200 text-xs font-normal relative z-10 mt-auto mb-6\">Option Selector</span>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n\n                        <div class=\"card-wrapper gs-card opacity-0 translate-y-12\">\n                            <div class=\"p-[1px] rounded-3xl bg-gradient-to-b from-white/10 to-transparent w-full aspect-square\">\n                                <div class=\"w-full h-full bg-[#0A0A0A] rounded-[23px] flex flex-col items-center justify-center gap-4 relative overflow-hidden\">\n                                     <div class=\"px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full border border-[#00E559]/30 bg-[#00E559]/5 flex items-center gap-1.5 relative z-10\">\n                                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:tag-price-linear\" class=\"text-sm text-[#00E559]\"></iconify-icon>\n                                        <span class=\"text-[#00E559] text-[10px] font-normal uppercase tracking-wider\">On Sale</span>\n                                     </div>\n                                    <span class=\"text-neutral-300 text-xs font-normal relative z-10\">Sale Tag</span>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n\n                         <div class=\"card-wrapper gs-card opacity-0 translate-y-12 hidden lg:block\">\n                            <div class=\"p-[1px] rounded-3xl bg-gradient-to-b from-white/5 to-transparent w-full aspect-square\">\n                                <div class=\"w-full h-full bg-[#0A0A0A] rounded-[23px] flex flex-col items-center justify-center gap-4 relative overflow-hidden opacity-60\">\n                                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:cart-large-linear\" class=\"text-3xl text-[#00E559] relative z-10\"></iconify-icon>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n\n                        <!-- Row 4 -->\n                        <div class=\"card-wrapper gs-card opacity-0 translate-y-12 col-start-1 sm:col-start-2\">\n                            <div class=\"p-[1px] rounded-3xl bg-gradient-to-b from-white/10 to-transparent w-full aspect-square\">\n                                <div class=\"w-full h-full bg-[#0A0A0A] rounded-[23px] flex flex-col items-center justify-center gap-4 relative overflow-hidden\">\n                                    <div class=\"w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-[#00E559] flex items-center justify-center relative z-10 shadow-[0_0_20px_rgba(0,229,89,0.2)]\">\n                                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:hashtag-linear\" class=\"text-2xl text-black\"></iconify-icon>\n                                    </div>\n                                    <span class=\"text-neutral-400 text-xs font-normal relative z-10 mt-1\">Count</span>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n\n                        <div class=\"card-wrapper gs-card opacity-0 translate-y-12 hidden sm:block\">\n                             <div class=\"p-[1px] rounded-3xl bg-gradient-to-b from-white/5 to-transparent w-full aspect-square\">\n                                <div class=\"w-full h-full bg-[#0A0A0A] rounded-[23px] opacity-30\"></div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n        </div>\n    </main>\n\n    <script>\n        // Ensure DOM is fully loaded before animating\n        document.addEventListener(\"DOMContentLoaded\", (event) => {\n            gsap.registerPlugin(ScrollTrigger);\n\n            // 1. Kicker text fade in and up\n            gsap.to(\".gs-reveal\", {\n                opacity: 1,\n                y: 0,\n                duration: 1,\n                ease: \"power3.out\",\n                delay: 0.2\n            });\n\n            // 2. Masked Staggered Word Reveal for Headline\n            gsap.to(\".gs-word\", {\n                y: \"0%\",\n                duration: 1.2,\n                ease: \"power4.out\",\n                stagger: 0.08,\n                delay: 0.4\n            });\n\n            // 3. Staggered entrance for the grid cards\n            gsap.to(\".gs-card\", {\n                opacity: 1,\n                y: 0,\n                duration: 1,\n                ease: \"back.out(1.2)\",\n                stagger: {\n                    amount: 0.8,\n                    grid: \"auto\",\n                    from: \"center\"\n                },\n                delay: 0.8 // Start after text reveal begins\n            });\n\n            // 4. Continuous ambient floating animation for the whole grid container\n            gsap.to(\".gs-float-wrapper\", {\n                y: -15,\n                duration: 4,\n                ease: \"sine.inOut\",\n                yoyo: true,\n                repeat: -1,\n                delay: 2 // Start floating after entrance animation\n            });\n        });\n    </script>\n</body>\n</html>", "preview_file_name": "dynamic-cart-data-shopify.html", "thumbnail_url": "https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/design-system-thumbnails/staff-featured-2026-05-22/dynamic-cart-data-shopify.jpg", "source_name": "dynamic-cart-data-shopify-DESIGN.md", "views": 219, "forks": 0, "private": false, "featured": true, "created_by": "8bd0314a-9525-4a13-996e-2c37cbd9e514", "created_at": "2026-05-22T07:58:12.433844+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-06-30T11:26:56.669329+00:00"}